90
00:04:19,190 --> 00:04:22,150
EPISODE FIVE
REI, BEYOND THE HEART

91
00:04:24,710 --> 00:04:26,960
Rei Ayanami, age fourteen.

92
00:04:26,960 --> 00:04:30,600
The first test subject chosen in
accordance with the Marduk Report.

93
00:04:30,600 --> 00:04:32,600
The First Child.

94
00:04:32,600 --> 00:04:36,280
She is the designated pilot for
Evangelion prototype Unit 00.

95
00:04:37,090 --> 00:04:40,880
Her past has been eradicated. All her
personal records were erased.

96
00:04:40,880 --> 00:04:44,080
So, what caused the accident during
the last experiment?

97
00:04:44,080 --> 00:04:45,550
We still don't know.

98
00:04:45,550 --> 00:04:51,450
However, we believe that mental instability
on the part of the pilot was a primary cause.

99
00:04:51,450 --> 00:04:54,320
Mental instability? In Rei?

100
00:04:54,320 --> 00:04:58,430
Yes, her mind became much more disturbed
than we had anticipated.

101
00:04:58,430 --> 00:04:59,560
So what happened?

102
00:04:59,560 --> 00:05:00,810
I don't know.

103
00:05:01,810 --> 00:05:04,000
But could it be...

104
00:05:04,000 --> 00:05:05,930
Did something occur to you?

105
00:05:05,930 --> 00:05:09,150
No, that can't be it.

106
00:05:33,480 --> 00:05:36,240
So this is our enemy.

107
00:05:41,150 --> 00:05:45,710
I see. Most everything except the core
remains intact.

108
00:05:45,710 --> 00:05:48,280
This is an ideal sample.

109
00:05:48,280 --> 00:05:49,340
I appreciate it!

110
00:05:49,340 --> 00:05:51,830
So, did you find anything new?

111
00:05:54,700 --> 00:05:56,180
What the heck is this?

112
00:05:56,180 --> 00:05:58,990
That's the code number for
"cannot be analyzed".

113
00:05:58,990 --> 00:06:01,260
You mean, you don't know
what the heck it is?

114
00:06:01,260 --> 00:06:05,160
Correct. We do know the Angel is
composed of a type of matter

115
00:06:05,160 --> 00:06:08,010
characterized by both particulate and
wave properties, like light.

116
00:06:10,380 --> 00:06:13,740
But you've at least found its power source,
haven't you?

117
00:06:13,740 --> 00:06:15,540
Something like that anyway.

118
00:06:15,540 --> 00:06:18,610
But we haven't been able to figure out
any of its operating principles.

119
00:06:18,610 --> 00:06:21,840
Well, I guess there's still a whole world
of things we don't know about yet.

120
00:06:21,840 --> 00:06:24,350
The world is filled with mysteries.

121
00:06:24,350 --> 00:06:26,280
For example, take a look at this.

122
00:06:26,280 --> 00:06:28,870
This is the Angel's inherent wave pattern.

123
00:06:30,470 --> 00:06:31,240
What? Let me see.

124
00:06:34,470 --> 00:06:35,720
Could this be...

125
00:06:35,720 --> 00:06:38,830
Yes. Although they are composed
of a different form of matter,

126
00:06:38,830 --> 00:06:41,900
their actual composition,
in terms of the arrangement

127
00:06:41,900 --> 00:06:45,800
and spacing of the pattern, falls within
a 99.89% match of human genes.

128
00:06:45,800 --> 00:06:48,740
99.89%?

129
00:06:48,740 --> 00:06:50,910
It really shows us just how limited
our level of understanding is.

130
00:06:50,910 --> 00:06:52,910
Bring it down... slowly...
It really shows us just how limited
our level of understanding is.

131
00:06:52,910 --> 00:06:53,240
Okay!
It really shows us just how limited
our level of understanding is.

132
00:06:53,240 --> 00:06:53,710
Okay!

133
00:06:53,710 --> 00:06:56,040
That's good. Stop.

134
00:06:56,040 --> 00:06:57,610
This is the core?

135
00:06:57,610 --> 00:06:58,780
How's the rest of it?

136
00:06:58,780 --> 00:07:02,780
It's pretty deteriorated. We can't expect
to use it as a reference.

137
00:07:02,780 --> 00:07:04,650
That's not a problem.
Dispose of the remnants.

138
00:07:04,650 --> 00:07:06,420
Yes, Sir.

139
00:07:06,420 --> 00:07:07,760
What's wrong?

140
00:07:07,760 --> 00:07:10,570
Well, nothing's wrong.

141
00:07:11,610 --> 00:07:16,000
Are you aware that when you say
"nothing" that way,

142
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:20,580
it's the same as asking others
to pay attention to you?

143
00:07:23,520 --> 00:07:28,580
Well, it's just that my father seems
to have burned his hands.

144
00:07:28,580 --> 00:07:29,710
Burned?

145
00:07:31,030 --> 00:07:33,380
I was just wondering how it happened.

146
00:07:33,380 --> 00:07:36,680
Burns? Do you know?

147
00:07:36,680 --> 00:07:38,850
It was before you arrived at Nerv.

148
00:07:38,850 --> 00:07:42,290
Unit 00 went berserk during
the activation experiments.

149
00:07:42,290 --> 00:07:43,630
You've heard about that, right?

150
00:07:43,630 --> 00:07:45,030
Yes.

151
00:07:45,030 --> 00:07:48,960
The pilot was trapped inside.

152
00:07:48,960 --> 00:07:51,900
The pilot? You mean Ayanami, right?

153
00:07:51,900 --> 00:07:54,670
It was Commander Ikari who rescued her.

154
00:07:54,670 --> 00:07:58,510
He opened the super-heated hatch
with his bare hands.

155
00:07:58,510 --> 00:08:00,180
My father did that?

156
00:08:01,420 --> 00:08:03,870
That's how he burned his hands.

157
00:08:07,560 --> 00:08:08,780
Go, Hideko!

158
00:08:08,780 --> 00:08:10,450
Come on, lose!

159
00:08:10,450 --> 00:08:13,490
You've got to treat us to pizza if you lose!

160
00:08:13,490 --> 00:08:14,920
There, go for it!

161
00:08:14,920 --> 00:08:16,100
You won't make it!

162
00:08:18,310 --> 00:08:19,760
Now, let's sink a shot!

163
00:08:22,040 --> 00:08:23,330
Oh my gosh! Those guys are looking at us!

164
00:08:23,330 --> 00:08:25,930
Perverts!
Oh my gosh! Those guys are looking at us!

165
00:08:25,930 --> 00:08:28,850
Man, they've all got such incredible breasts.

166
00:08:29,570 --> 00:08:32,810
Suzuhara's ogling us! Gross!

167
00:08:32,810 --> 00:08:33,510
Hi, Shinji!
Suzuhara's ogling us! Gross!

168
00:08:33,510 --> 00:08:34,490
Hi, Shinji!

169
00:08:35,690 --> 00:08:37,580
Hey, Chief!

170
00:08:37,580 --> 00:08:39,750
What're you lookin' at so intently?

171
00:08:39,750 --> 00:08:40,850
Nothing!

172
00:08:40,850 --> 00:08:42,850
Was it Ayanami? Am I right?

173
00:08:42,850 --> 00:08:44,520
No!

174
00:08:44,520 --> 00:08:48,460
Oh, come on. That's suspicious...

175
00:08:48,460 --> 00:08:50,160
Ayanami's boobs...

176
00:08:50,160 --> 00:08:51,990
Ayanami's thighs...

177
00:08:51,990 --> 00:08:53,050
Ayanami's...

178
00:08:53,220 --> 00:08:55,430
...calves!

179
00:08:55,430 --> 00:08:57,270
I told you, it's nothing like that.

180
00:08:57,270 --> 00:08:59,000
Then, what were you looking at?

181
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:00,780
You can't fool me.

182
00:09:03,380 --> 00:09:07,250
I was just wondering why she's always alone.

183
00:09:08,690 --> 00:09:11,150
Come to think of it,

184
00:09:11,150 --> 00:09:14,580
she hasn't had any friends since
she started here in the seventh grade.

185
00:09:14,580 --> 00:09:17,750
There's just something about her that
makes her hard to approach.

186
00:09:17,750 --> 00:09:20,500
She's probably just got a lousy personality.

187
00:09:23,840 --> 00:09:28,530
You're both Eva pilots, right?
You should know her better than us.

188
00:09:28,530 --> 00:09:30,200
He's right.

189
00:09:30,200 --> 00:09:33,880
Well, I've hardly spoken to her.

190
00:09:34,820 --> 00:09:37,910
Eva Unit 01 is now entering
the third stage cooling process.

191
00:09:37,910 --> 00:09:42,310
Lower all systems to Phase 3 in Cage 6.

192
00:09:42,310 --> 00:09:45,510
The earlier harmonics and
synchronization tests were good.

193
00:09:45,510 --> 00:09:47,120
All numerical conditions
have been satisfied.

194
00:09:47,120 --> 00:09:49,920
Roger. Transmit the results to Balthazar.

195
00:09:49,920 --> 00:09:51,220
Roger.

196
00:09:51,220 --> 00:09:55,760
Transmit the full range of the entry plug's
personal data to Melchior.

197
00:09:55,760 --> 00:09:57,450
Data transmitting.

198
00:09:57,450 --> 00:09:59,860
This is Melchior, roger. Circuits connected.

199
00:09:59,860 --> 00:10:02,080
Initiating third stage cooling process.

200
00:10:02,080 --> 00:10:04,470
CBL circulation has begun.

201
00:10:04,470 --> 00:10:06,730
Condensation reactor,
commencing operation.

202
00:10:06,730 --> 00:10:09,070
Vent waste fluid to the second
purification system.

203
00:10:09,070 --> 00:10:12,470
The protein walls are in good condition.
No problems detected.

204
00:10:12,470 --> 00:10:15,960
T minus 1,050 minutes until the Unit 00
re-activation experiment.

205
00:10:18,730 --> 00:10:20,680
What is this?!

206
00:10:20,680 --> 00:10:22,250
It's curry.

207
00:10:22,250 --> 00:10:24,850
So you're still eating this instant stuff.

208
00:10:24,850 --> 00:10:27,500
Look, you're a guest, so you've got
no right to complain.

209
00:10:29,570 --> 00:10:31,590
What about you, Miss Misato?

210
00:10:31,590 --> 00:10:32,880
For me...

211
00:10:32,150 --> 00:10:33,820
Super Cup

212
00:10:34,080 --> 00:10:38,930
Ta-da! Just pour it right in here!

213
00:10:38,930 --> 00:10:40,500
Are you serious?

214
00:10:40,500 --> 00:10:43,300
Oh, don't you know how good this is?

215
00:10:43,300 --> 00:10:44,170
Okay...

216
00:10:44,170 --> 00:10:48,700
Ordinary curry flavored instant ramen
can't compare to this!

217
00:10:49,760 --> 00:10:52,010
Let's eat!

218
00:10:52,010 --> 00:10:55,130
The trick is to put less hot water in the soup.

219
00:11:01,270 --> 00:11:03,490
Misato cooked this, didn't she?

220
00:11:03,490 --> 00:11:04,060
Yes.
Misato cooked this, didn't she?

221
00:11:04,060 --> 00:11:05,390
Yes.
Oh, can you tell?

222
00:11:05,390 --> 00:11:06,230
Oh, can you tell?

223
00:11:06,230 --> 00:11:07,360
Yes, by its taste.

224
00:11:07,360 --> 00:11:10,160
How can she make something
ready-to-eat taste so awful?

225
00:11:10,160 --> 00:11:14,620
Next time, invite me when
it's Shinji's turn to cook.

226
00:11:34,240 --> 00:11:36,790
Shinji, you really ought to move out.

227
00:11:36,790 --> 00:11:41,010
You shouldn't let one bad roommate
ruin your life.

228
00:11:41,010 --> 00:11:42,740
I'm used to it now.

229
00:11:42,740 --> 00:11:44,800
He's right, Ritsuko.

230
00:11:44,800 --> 00:11:46,600
Never underestimate the ability
of the human animal

231
00:11:46,600 --> 00:11:48,900
to adapt to its environment.

232
00:11:48,900 --> 00:11:51,370
And anyway, if he does move...

233
00:11:51,370 --> 00:11:53,780
Shinji, can you bring me
another one, please?

234
00:11:53,780 --> 00:11:54,810
Right.

235
00:11:54,810 --> 00:11:56,610
The red tape would be a pain.

236
00:11:56,610 --> 00:11:59,950
He just got his permanent security card,
you know.

237
00:11:59,950 --> 00:12:02,120
Oh, I almost forgot!

238
00:12:02,120 --> 00:12:04,250
Shinji, would you do me a favor?

239
00:12:04,250 --> 00:12:05,650
What is it?

240
00:12:05,650 --> 00:12:07,500
Rei Ayanami's renewal card.

241
00:12:08,370 --> 00:12:10,660
I keep forgetting to give this to her.

242
00:12:10,660 --> 00:12:15,830
Would you mind delivering it
before you go to headquarters?

243
00:12:15,830 --> 00:12:16,670
Sure.

244
00:12:23,020 --> 00:12:26,810
What's the matter?
You're staring at Rei's picture.

245
00:12:26,810 --> 00:12:28,540
Nothing!

246
00:12:28,540 --> 00:12:30,580
Shinji, don't tell me...

247
00:12:30,580 --> 00:12:31,810
No!

248
00:12:31,810 --> 00:12:35,350
Oh, come on! You're blushing!

249
00:12:35,350 --> 00:12:37,590
Well, you've got an official excuse
to go to Rei's place now.

250
00:12:37,590 --> 00:12:38,650
This is your chance, isn't it?

251
00:12:40,400 --> 00:12:42,400
Stop teasing me!

252
00:12:43,810 --> 00:12:46,690
But I love teasing you.
You always take it so seriously!

253
00:12:46,690 --> 00:12:48,830
Just like Misato.

254
00:12:48,830 --> 00:12:52,030
I just find it strange that I know
so little about Ayanami,

255
00:12:52,030 --> 00:12:54,240
even though we're both Eva pilots.

256
00:12:54,240 --> 00:12:57,640
She's a very nice girl,
but she's like your father.

257
00:12:57,640 --> 00:12:59,870
She's not very adept.

258
00:12:59,870 --> 00:13:01,550
Not adept at what?

259
00:13:03,190 --> 00:13:04,470
Living.

260
00:13:22,940 --> 00:13:25,070
Ayanami

261
00:13:41,660 --> 00:13:43,300
Excuse me?

262
00:13:46,930 --> 00:13:49,870
Excuse me, it's Ikari.

263
00:13:51,670 --> 00:13:53,440
I'm coming in, Ayanami!

264
00:14:31,050 --> 00:14:32,550
Are these hers?

265
00:14:46,230 --> 00:14:48,530
Well...

266
00:14:51,740 --> 00:14:53,430
I didn't mean...

267
00:15:29,770 --> 00:15:31,070
Do you mind moving?

268
00:15:35,140 --> 00:15:36,850
I...

269
00:15:54,860 --> 00:15:56,450
What is it?

270
00:15:56,450 --> 00:16:00,770
Well, I mean, I was...

271
00:16:04,370 --> 00:16:09,300
I was asked to, so...

272
00:16:09,300 --> 00:16:11,530
What was it? The card, your card...

273
00:16:11,530 --> 00:16:13,630
It's been renewed!

274
00:16:13,630 --> 00:16:15,480
I was asked to deliver it.

275
00:16:17,920 --> 00:16:22,080
So... So, I didn't mean
for any of this to happen.

276
00:16:28,500 --> 00:16:31,430
Miss Ritsuko said she forgot to give it to you.

277
00:16:32,400 --> 00:16:36,120
It's true. I rang your bell,
but there was no reply,

278
00:16:36,120 --> 00:16:39,040
and the door was unlocked. So...

279
00:16:58,290 --> 00:17:02,380
<i>Central Dogma is currently
open to the public.</i>

280
00:17:02,380 --> 00:17:04,900
<i>Group 3 should proceed directly
to the fourth gate.</i>

281
00:17:08,130 --> 00:17:12,210
This is your new card. Miss Ritsuko
asked me to deliver it to you.

282
00:17:19,850 --> 00:17:21,800
I'm sorry about earlier.

283
00:17:21,800 --> 00:17:23,390
About what?

284
00:17:26,850 --> 00:17:30,360
You have a re-activation experiment
today, don't you?

285
00:17:31,860 --> 00:17:34,230
Wouldn't it be great if it were
successful this time?

286
00:17:37,770 --> 00:17:44,730
Say, aren't you afraid of getting in
Unit 00 again?

287
00:17:44,730 --> 00:17:46,310
Why?

288
00:17:48,610 --> 00:17:52,330
I heard that you were hurt pretty badly
in an earlier experiment,

289
00:17:52,330 --> 00:17:54,550
so I was wondering if you were okay about it.

290
00:17:57,550 --> 00:18:00,840
Aren't you Commander Ikari's son?

291
00:18:00,840 --> 00:18:01,810
Yeah.

292
00:18:01,810 --> 00:18:05,450
Don't you have faith in your
own father's work?

293
00:18:05,450 --> 00:18:08,020
Of course not! How could I trust him?

294
00:18:11,830 --> 00:18:12,520
What?

295
00:18:32,590 --> 00:18:35,540
Rei, are you all right?

296
00:18:35,540 --> 00:18:37,130
Rei...

297
00:18:38,960 --> 00:18:42,780
The pilot was trapped inside.

298
00:18:42,780 --> 00:18:45,720
It was Commander Ikari who rescued her.

299
00:18:45,720 --> 00:18:49,090
He opened the super-heated hatch
with his bare hands.

300
00:18:49,090 --> 00:18:51,340
That's how he burned his hands.

301
00:19:00,250 --> 00:19:01,640
Rei.

302
00:19:01,640 --> 00:19:03,000
Can you hear me?

303
00:19:03,000 --> 00:19:04,410
Yes.

304
00:19:04,410 --> 00:19:08,110
We will now commence the Unit 00
re-activation experiment.

305
00:19:08,110 --> 00:19:09,660
First stage connection initiated.

306
00:19:11,090 --> 00:19:13,250
Connecting main power supply.

307
00:19:13,250 --> 00:19:15,580
Activation voltage has passed
the critical point.

308
00:19:15,580 --> 00:19:16,850
Roger.

309
00:19:16,850 --> 00:19:19,170
Shift format to Phase 2.

310
00:19:19,170 --> 00:19:21,390
Connecting pilot to Unit 00.

311
00:19:21,390 --> 00:19:23,100
Opening circuits.

312
00:19:25,180 --> 00:19:27,440
Pulse and harmonics are normal.

313
00:19:28,440 --> 00:19:30,100
No problems detected in synchronization.

314
00:19:30,100 --> 00:19:31,580
All nerve links completed.

315
00:19:33,020 --> 00:19:35,100
Central nervous system
elements are nominal.

316
00:19:35,100 --> 00:19:36,880
Re-calculating, no error corrections.

317
00:19:38,290 --> 00:19:41,150
Checklist is satisfactory up to 2590.

318
00:19:41,490 --> 00:19:43,080
Approaching the absolute borderline.

319
00:19:43,080 --> 00:19:44,550
2.5 more.

320
00:19:44,550 --> 00:19:45,750
1.7...

321
00:19:45,750 --> 00:19:46,850
1.2...

322
00:19:46,850 --> 00:19:48,120
1.0...

323
00:19:48,120 --> 00:19:49,380
0.8...

324
00:19:49,380 --> 00:19:50,580
0.6...

325
00:19:50,580 --> 00:19:51,750
0.5...

326
00:19:51,750 --> 00:19:52,990
0.4...

327
00:19:52,990 --> 00:19:54,190
0.3...

328
00:19:54,190 --> 00:19:55,390
0.2...

329
00:19:55,390 --> 00:19:57,960
0.1, and rising.

330
00:19:57,960 --> 00:20:00,060
Borderline cleared.

331
00:20:00,060 --> 00:20:02,300
Unit 00 has been activated.

332
00:20:02,300 --> 00:20:03,460
Roger.

333
00:20:03,460 --> 00:20:05,830
Beginning interlock test.

334
00:20:05,830 --> 00:20:06,640
Roger.

335
00:20:11,590 --> 00:20:15,710
Ikari, an unidentified flying object
is approaching.

336
00:20:15,710 --> 00:20:17,140
It is likely the fifth Angel.

337
00:20:17,140 --> 00:20:21,480
Stop the test. All personnel,
alert status Level One.

338
00:20:21,480 --> 00:20:24,120
You're not going to use Unit 00?

339
00:20:24,120 --> 00:20:27,250
She's not ready to fight yet.
What's the status on Unit 01?

340
00:20:27,250 --> 00:20:29,560
It'll be ready in 380 seconds.

341
00:20:29,560 --> 00:20:30,560
Engage!

342
00:20:30,560 --> 00:20:31,260
Yes, Sir.

343
00:20:31,260 --> 00:20:32,060
Rei.
Yes, Sir.

344
00:20:32,060 --> 00:20:32,530
Rei.

345
00:20:32,530 --> 00:20:35,270
Re-activation was successful.
Return now.

346
00:20:59,730 --> 00:21:02,020
The target is passing over Tonosawa.

347
00:21:02,020 --> 00:21:04,370
Unit 01 is beginning launch preparations.

348
00:21:05,570 --> 00:21:07,240
Releasing primary lock bolts.

349
00:21:09,210 --> 00:21:10,330
Release confirmed.

350
00:21:10,330 --> 00:21:11,170
Roger.
Release confirmed.

351
00:21:11,170 --> 00:21:11,830
Roger.
Releasing secondary restraints.

352
00:21:11,830 --> 00:21:12,830
Releasing secondary restraints.

353
00:21:12,830 --> 00:21:13,790
Roger.

354
00:21:13,790 --> 00:21:16,500
The target is now intruding into
Lake Ashino airspace.

355
00:21:16,500 --> 00:21:19,410
Eva Unit 01 is ready for launch.

356
00:21:19,410 --> 00:21:20,250
Launch!

357
00:21:27,130 --> 00:21:29,680
We're detecting a high energy reaction
from inside the target!

358
00:21:29,680 --> 00:21:30,720
What?!

359
00:21:30,720 --> 00:21:33,050
The circumference area is accelerating!
It's converging!

360
00:21:33,050 --> 00:21:33,680
It can't be!

361
00:21:40,690 --> 00:21:41,860
No, dodge it!

362
00:21:58,460 --> 00:21:59,460
Shinji!

363
00:21:59,500 --> 00:22:00,710
TO BE CONTINUED

364
00:23:06,230 --> 00:23:07,110
PREVIEW

365
00:23:08,070 --> 00:23:12,220
Shinji is saved, but his injuries
cause him to act spoiled.

366
00:23:12,220 --> 00:23:13,550
Rei pushes him away.

367
00:23:13,550 --> 00:23:17,040
Meanwhile, Misato tries to mount
a pin-point attack on the Angel.

368
00:23:17,040 --> 00:23:21,310
Next Evangelion:
"Decisive Battle, New Tokyo-3"

369
00:23:19,120 --> 00:23:21,250
DECISIVE BATTLE, NEW TOKYO-3
